# Shell styling (root)

- **Input → output**: `style/input.css` → `style/style.css` via `bun run build:css` / `bun run watch:css` (see root `package.json`).
- **Config**: `tailwind.config.js` at repo root — drives the AGS-loaded stylesheet referenced in `app.ts` (`css: "./style/style.css"`).
- **Not the same as**: `ui/tailwind.config.js` (Vite React bundle). Editing the wrong file leaves one surface unstaged.

After changing utilities or `@apply`, ensure `style/style.css` is regenerated before judging appearance under `ags run`.
